#N canvas 40 40 1300 800 12;
#X text 20 5 [ddj-loops N] - beat loop / loop roll pads for deck N (d\$1-padmode 1 / 2). inlets: phasor~ phase \, length \, samplerate \, phasor freq \, track bpm \, first beat (s). outlets: looped phase~ \, phase to set the phasor to;
